OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly cloudy but
OL,6,Fgenerally dry, best of any brightness
OL,7,Fin the west. A few showery outbreaks
OL,8,Fof rain possible, mainly over the
OL,9,Fhills. Moderate easterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy but mostly dry in the
OL,12,Fevening with just a few spots of light
OL,13,Frain. Rain will turn more persistent
OL,14,Fand occasionally heavy overnight.
OL,15,FBecoming breezy around the coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
