OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy with persistent and
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain in the
OL,7,Fmorning. Staying cloudy throughout the
OL,8,Fday but rain gradually easing. Drier
OL,9,Fin the west. Windy at times,
OL,10,Fparticularly around the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FFurther
OL,13,Frain or showers, occasionally heavy,
OL,14,Fbut also with some drier and brighter
OL,15,Fspells at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
